From: SJ Park <sj@kernel.org>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 10:14:05 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] mm/damon/Kconfig: elaborate vaddr test config prompt

DAMON_VADDR_KUIT_TEST prompt is not specifying what address space
operation set the test is for.  Explicitly specify it is only for the
virtual address operation set.

Signed-off-by: SJ Park <sj@kernel.org>
---
 mm/damon/Kconfig | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/mm/damon/Kconfig b/mm/damon/Kconfig
index 26109d63a9d88..67eb1890c624e 100644
--- a/mm/damon/Kconfig
+++ b/mm/damon/Kconfig
@@ -65,7 +65,7 @@ config DAMON_PADDR
 	  that works for the physical address space.
 
 config DAMON_VADDR_KUNIT_TEST
-	bool "Test for DAMON operations" if !KUNIT_ALL_TESTS
+	bool "Test for DAMON virtual address operations" if !KUNIT_ALL_TESTS
 	depends on DAMON_VADDR && KUNIT=y
 	default KUNIT_ALL_TESTS
 	help
-- 
2.47.3

